{%- comment -%}
  Icons for fa-faq, fa-book-visit and fa-footer (paths exported from Figma, fills set to currentColor).
  Usage: {% render 'fa-icons-footer', icon: 'pin' %}
  Icons: pin, mail, phone (solid), navigate (desktop maps button), navigate-sm (mobile maps button, Figma 414:1495),
  facebook, instagram (footer outline glyph, Figma 414:931), tiktok,
  chevron-lg (desktop newsletter submit, Figma 414:954), chevron-md (mobile newsletter submit, Figma 414:1537).
  Both point left; rotate them in CSS. They are Figma's chevron_backward stretched to different aspect ratios
  (10.4x17.9 and 7.9x14.5 glyphs vs 5.7x9.6 for the base chevron), so they are separate drawings.
  The FAQ toggle chevron and the clock come from the shared fa-icon snippet.
  chevron-acc: mobile footer accordion chevron (Figma 2519:4184 "Vector 5", 13 x 5, 1.5px stroke), drawn pointing
  down; CSS flips it when the column is open.
{%- endcomment -%}
